# The champion with the interception bounded (guard_cap 3): the three
# nearest engageable reserve units answer a raider inside the outpost
# radius and the rest keep gathering toward the wave, where zero commits
# the whole reserve. The sibling of evolve1-g4m2-noicpt on the same
# read (attrbar96, log 2026-09-13): if the interception drains the
# mid-window exchange because it disbands the offence, a bounded answer
# keeps the wave and the extractors both; if the raiders are simply
# uncatchable, the bound changes nothing and the off arm says so. The
# population search moved this knob and settled at zero, which is a
# generation fitness, not a paired verdict on the bar. Every other knob
# and every goals slot is the champion's exactly.
name evolve1-g4m2-guard3
goals extractorT1,extractorT1,extractorT1,c_tank,c_tank,c_tank,heavyTank,hoverTank
heavies heavyTank,heavyTank
max_workers 8
mass 25
reserve -1
